# Source documents are fetched, never vendored.
#
# Every NTRS record in MANIFEST.json is PUBLIC_USE_PERMITTED with
# belongsToUsGov: false -- public use is permitted, but these are not US
# Government works in the public domain, so this repository does not
# redistribute them. Run fetch_corpus.py to populate these directories; the
# manifest's SHA-256 proves you got what was transcribed.
bundle_*/source/
